==Battleground==
*The enemy base's HP starts at 800,000 and increases by 40,000 with each stage.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Super Hyppoh]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*3 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*2 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Tackey]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*3 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 146.67 seconds<sup>4,400f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Croconator]]s spawn after 233.33 seconds<sup>7,000f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

